    ("---\nname: run-optimization\ndescription: Run strategy optimization with grid search\n---\n\n# Run Optimization Skill\n\nUse this skill to perform grid search optimization on a specific strategy configuration.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Configure Optimization Range\n\nEdit `StrategyFactory/run_optimization.py` to set the parameter grid:\n\n```python\nparam_grid = {\n    'stop_loss': [1.0, 1.5, 2.0],  # ATR multipliers\n    'take_profit': [1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 2.5],\n    'indicator_period': [10, 14, 20, 28]\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Run Optimization Script\n\n```powershell\npython StrategyFactory/run_optimization.py\n```\n\n### 3. Review Validation Report\n\nThe script calculates In-Sample vs Out-of-Sample performance:\n\n```powershell\nGet-ChildItem StrategyFactory/reports/optimization_*.json | Sort-Object LastWriteTime -Descending | Select-Object -First 1 | Get-Content\n```\n\n## Robustness Criteria\n\nA strategy PASSES optimization only if:\n1. **OOS Profit** > 0\n2. **Sharpe Difference** (IS vs OOS) < 20%\n3. **Stability Score** > 0.7\n\n## Output\n\n- `StrategyFactory/reports/optimization_[timestamp].json`\n- Contains best parameters and performance metrics\n", True),
